      "sourceTextSha256": "0c6f634a5e363b30b2c2dd261b2aa3a777cac1cfd86a03a6fa5db77f1b748456",
      "text": "Day 2 · After breakfast, a city tour of about 4 hours: viewpoints over the city and Mount Illimani, the historic centre and the famous Witches’ Market (Mercado de las Brujas). Then an excursion to the Moon Valley (Valle de la Luna), a striking landscape of eroded clay peaks and spires on the outskirts of La Paz.\n\nAccommodation: Casa Grande Suites, Presidential Suite, breakfast",
